# Agent orchestration

**Multi-step** or **multi-layer** task in `ui/` or `src/` (not a [Quick fix](.cursor/skills/platform-agents/workflows.md#quick-fix-skip-full-workflow)):

1. [workflows.md](.cursor/skills/platform-agents/workflows.md) or [bugfix.md](.cursor/skills/platform-agents/bugfix.md) — pick recipe.
2. [platform-agents/SKILL.md](.cursor/skills/platform-agents/SKILL.md) — one domain agent per pass; handoffs between steps.
3. After each domain agent → [specialists/](.cursor/specialists/README.md) for supplementary `.agents/skills/` ([specialists.mdc](specialists.mdc)).

Details live in `workflows.md` — do not duplicate here.
